<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY--PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON  Sappi    YR EPS   266.6	200.0-320.0    846.0</p>
<p>MON  Sappi    YR DIV    90.0	 70.0-120.0    120.0</p>
<p>MON  Absa     H1 EPS    94.6	 91.4-96.5     73.1</p>
<p>MON  Absa     H1 DIV    27.0	 25.5-28.2     21.5</p>
<p>TUE  Anglo    H1 EPS 1,070.0    1,035.0-1,130.0  837.0</p>
<p>TUE  Anglo    H1 DIV   153.0	150.0-160.0    130.0</p>
<p>TUE  Foschini H1 EPS    39.4	39.0-39.6	44.0</p>
<p>WED  Metcash  H1 EPS    38.0	37.0-38.6	31.4</p>
<p>WED  Metcash  H1 DIV    15.0	14.7-15.4	12.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Sappi results will be released from Monday. Previous results are proforma due to change in year end.</p>
<p>Foschini declares a dividend at the end of the financial year only.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
